  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopia HRD 2009 OCHA - OCHA Eti 2009 HRF</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Etiopien HRD 2009 OCHA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;det best&#xE5;r av tv&#xE5; komponenter:  1. 45 MSEK g&#xE5;r till den OCHA-ledda pooled fund HRF (Humanitarian Response Fund). Som framg&#xE5;r av avtal kan detta bidrag efter Sidas godk. &#xE4;ven anv&#xE4;ndas till M&amp;E-insatser, (f&#xF6;retr&#xE4;delsevis f&#xF6;r  utv&#xE4;rderingsprojekt p&#xE5; f&#xF6;rslag fr&#xE5;n Feinstein Int.Centre). 2. 5 MSEK st&#xF6;d till OCHAs samordningsverksamhet i Etiopien.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution contains 2 components:  1. 45 MSEK to the Humanitarian Response Fund,coordinated by OCHA. As stated in agreement this component can, subject to Sida approval, also be used for spec. M&amp;E-interventions, (preferably evaluation project suggested by Feinstein Int.Centre).  2. 5 MSEK to OCHA Ethiopia for coordination services.</narrative>
  </description>
